PN,37101
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785503909
OL,3,CMet officers' use of WhatsApp
OL,4,Cdisappearing messages is lawful, High
OL,5,CCourt rules
OL,7,FThe Metropolitan Police's policy on
OL,8,Fofficers' use of WhatsApp's
OL,9,Fdisappearing messages feature is
OL,10,Flawful, a High Court judge has ruled.
OL,12,FA man known only as BB took legal
OL,13,Faction against the force last year
OL,14,Fover the policy allowing officers to
OL,15,Fuse the function, following his arrest
OL,16,Fin May 2024 on suspicion of
OL,17,Fcontrolling and coercive behaviour.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/8
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785503909
OL,3,CMet officers' use of WhatsApp
OL,4,Cdisappearing messages is lawful, High
OL,5,CCourt rules
OL,7,FThe disappearing chat function
OL,8,Fautomatically deletes messages, images
OL,9,Fand other data in WhatsApp
OL,10,Fconversations 24 hours, seven days or
OL,11,F90 days after they are sent.
OL,13,FThe guidance, introduced by the Met in
OL,14,F2023, tells officers that chats on the
OL,15,Fplatform should be deleted after 90
OL,16,Fdays, but that any evidential material
OL,17,Fshared by members of the public must
OL,18,Fbe exported to another system
OL,19,Fbeforehand.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/8
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785503909
OL,3,CMet officers' use of WhatsApp
OL,4,Cdisappearing messages is lawful, High
OL,5,CCourt rules
OL,7,FBB's lawyers told a hearing in May
OL,8,Fthat the policy was unlawful as it
OL,9,F"authorises and approves unlawful
OL,10,Fconduct", is unreasonable and
OL,11,Frepresents an interference with his
OL,12,Fright to a fair trial.
OL,14,FThe Met defended the claim, arguing
OL,15,Fthat the policy is lawful, with Mr
OL,16,FJustice McKendrick dismissing the
OL,17,Fchallenge on Friday.
OL,26,@qD@AOUrD@HO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/8
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785503909
OL,3,CMet officers' use of WhatsApp
OL,4,Cdisappearing messages is lawful, High
OL,5,CCourt rules
OL,7,FIn a 44-page ruling, he said that
OL,8,Fwhile he had "reservations" about the
OL,9,Frisk of deleting material which could
OL,10,Fbe relevant for criminal proceedings,
OL,11,Fthe guidance "directs officers to use
OL,12,FWhatsApp in a limited way" and "does
OL,13,Fnot involve a misstatement of the law".
OL,15,FHe continued that the force "carefully
OL,16,Fconsidered the context of rolling out
OL,17,FWhatsApp to Metropolitan Police
OL,18,Fdevices over a period of time and
OL,19,Fcarried out consultation with
OL,20,Fstakeholders in respect of this
OL,21,Fprocess".
OL,26,@pD@NOUpD@[O]sD@NOUtD@ZO]tD@`OUuD@fO]wD@
OL,26,A]OU}D@HO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/8
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785503909
OL,3,CMet officers' use of WhatsApp
OL,4,Cdisappearing messages is lawful, High
OL,5,CCourt rules
OL,7,FHe added: "I cannot accept the
OL,8,Fsubmission that the existence of
OL,9,Fguidance or its application violates
OL,10,Fany of the claimant's... rights to a
OL,11,Ffair trial or infringes his common law
OL,12,Frights to a fair hearing."
OL,14,FBB was arrested in May 2024 on
OL,15,Fsuspicion of controlling and coercive
OL,16,Fbehaviour towards his former partner,
OL,17,Fwho also accused him of sexual assault.
OL,26,@oD@KOUtD@ZO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/8
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785503909
OL,3,CMet officers' use of WhatsApp
OL,4,Cdisappearing messages is lawful, High
OL,5,CCourt rules
OL,7,FWhile he was not charged with sexual
OL,8,Fassault, he was later charged with
OL,9,Fbreaching a non-molestation order, and
OL,10,Fis due to stand trial.
OL,12,FOfficers told the High Court that the
OL,13,Fuse of WhatsApp was introduced to
OL,14,Fimprove communication with
OL,15,Fstakeholders, and that the force used
OL,16,Fthe 90-day limit to avoid the
OL,17,Findefinite accumulation of thousands
OL,18,Fof officers' data.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/8
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785503909
OL,3,CMet officers' use of WhatsApp
OL,4,Cdisappearing messages is lawful, High
OL,5,CCourt rules
OL,7,FThe guidance says that officers must
OL,8,Fuse the force's crest as their profile
OL,9,Fimage, and must show their full name
OL,10,Fand rank.
OL,12,FIt says that disappearing messages
OL,13,Fmust be selected for all chats, with
OL,14,Fthe timer set to 90 days.
OL,16,FOfficers are not required to use the
OL,17,Fplatform, with the guidance stating
OL,18,Fthat "careful consideration should be
OL,19,Fmade as to whether it is the most
OL,20,Fappropriate tool to use".
OL,26,@zD@FOU|D@XO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/8
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785503909
OL,3,CMet officers' use of WhatsApp
OL,4,Cdisappearing messages is lawful, High
OL,5,CCourt rules
OL,7,FIt continues that sensitive
OL,8,Finformation, evidential material and
OL,9,Foperational information must not be
OL,10,Fshared, but adds: "There may be times
OL,11,Fwhere members of the public
OL,12,Funexpectedly send evidential material
OL,13,Fthrough instant messaging, or the
OL,14,Fmessage is believed to be of
OL,15,Fevidential value.
OL,17,F"If this occurs, then the chat can be
OL,18,Fexported... and uploaded... by the
OL,19,Fuser, as soon as possible, and all
OL,20,Factions properly recorded."
OL,26,@rD@SOUyD@AOU|D@[O]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G8/8
